# Every text file is checked out with LF, on every platform. The generators
# and the installer hash raw file bytes (the sha256 over shipped agent/skill
# files, the source-hash header the Codex/Copilot generators embed, the TOML
# literal blocks they compare) and a Windows CRLF checkout would change every
# one of those hashes without changing a single character of content.
#
# No asset in this package is binary or needs to keep CRLF, so one blanket
# rule covers everything; nothing here is excluded from it.
* text=auto eol=lf
